ISRAEL ARMY BOT TICKET — RAILWAY

1. Upload:
   index.js
   deploy-commands.js
   config.js
   package.json

2. Railway Variables:
   TOKEN=your_discord_bot_token

3. Railway Volume:
   /app/data

4. Start Command:
   npm run deploy && npm start

5. Discord Developer Portal:
   Enable:
   - SERVER MEMBERS INTENT
   - MESSAGE CONTENT INTENT

6. Bot permissions recommended:
   - View Channels
   - Send Messages
   - Embed Links
   - Attach Files
   - Read Message History
   - Manage Channels
   - Manage Messages
